<title>SPAIN: Spain's 1-year bill rate inches up to 6.508 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's 1-year bill rate inches up to 6.508 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>1-year     6.508    6.503   93.81    93.83   371.421  239.825</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
